      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "At first glance, you might mistake this for a mere architectural vanity project—a fancy, hyper-dense display stand meant to show off your glowing alchemical trinkets to visitors. But do not be fooled by its elegant appearance. The Dark Matter Pedestal is a localized reality-warping focal point. By placing a magical artifact upon its apex, the pedestal amplifies and projects the item\u0027s latent energy across the surrounding area.\n\nFunctionally, this is your ultimate base-automation station! As the tooltip clearly states, placing specific rings or amulets onto the pedestal will unlock and project powerful, continuous Area-of-Effect (AoE) functions. Need an automated farm? Slap a Harvest Goddess Band on it. Need an impenetrable defense grid? See what happens when you mount an offensive ring. Read those tooltips carefully, place your artifacts, and watch your factory come alive!",
